          "short": "(I)",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}-\\log_{1/a}(x)&=-\\frac{\\log_a(x)}{\\log_a(1/a)}\\\\-\\log_{1/a}(x)&=-\\frac{\\log_a(x)}{-1}\\\\-\\log_{1/a}(x)&=\\log_a(x)\\end{align*}$$\nFor $x>0$, this is the increasing curve in diagram (I).",
