        "answer": {
          "short": "(II)",
          "worked": "The logarithm requires $\\frac{1}{x}>0$, so $x>0$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\log_a\\left(\\frac1x\\right)&=\\log_a(1)-\\log_a(x)\\\\\\log_a\\left(\\frac1x\\right)&=-\\log_a(x)\\end{align*}$$\nDiagram (II).",
